          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கண்டறி — kaṇṭaṟi — \"to find out; to discover\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காரணத்தைக் கண்டறிந்தால் தீர்வு கிடைக்கும். kāraṇattaik kaṇṭaṟintāl tīrvu kiṭaikkum. If we find out the cause, we will find a solution."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): கண்டறிந்தேன், kaṇṭaṟintēṉ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is found takes -ஐ. A more formal word than கண்டுபிடி."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "கண்டறி (kaṇṭaṟi) is native: kaṇṭu, \"having seen\", from kāṇ (DEDR 1443), and aṟi, \"to know\" (DEDR 314): to see and come to know."
            }
          ]
        },
